    "headline": "Dominion Energy (D) Starts Requiring Bank Guarantees For AI Data Center Power Deals",
    "summary": "Dominion Energy (NYSE:D) is asking AI data center developers to provide bank letters of credit to secure large power commitments. The utility is using financial guarantees to screen speculative projects tied to rapid AI related power demand. The shift is intended to limit potential financial risk for Dominion Energy and its customer base as grid investment needs grow. Rising power needs from AI data centers are reshaping grid investment plans, so it can be useful to look at other companies...",
